        "Content": "Features:\r\n\r\n* Three-bedroom home\r\n* Spacious main bedroom with walk-in wardrobe\r\n* Private en-suite shower room\r\n* Two further well-proportioned bedrooms\r\n* Bright and comfortable living room with feature fireplace\r\n* Generous kitchen/dining area\r\n* Convenient downstairs WC\r\n* Family bathroom\r\n* Enclosed rear garden with lawn and mature planting\r\n* Timber garden shed providing additional storage\r\n* Well-presented accommodation throughout\r\n* Gas-fired central heating\r\n* Double-glazed windows\r\n* Convenient Balbriggan location\r\n* Excellent selection of local schools and amenities nearby\r\n* Easy access to Balbriggan town centre and train station\r\n* Convenient access to the M1 motorway"
